stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reserved: live binding and session / reserve input HMAC and generation
    Reserved --> Reserved: concurrent same-input request / no dispatch or deadline extension
    Reserved --> Uncertain: timeout or dependency or invalid protocol / retain original attempt
    Reserved --> Installed: verified response and live binding and generation CAS
    Uncertain --> Uncertain: receipt dependency failure / retain original deadline
    Uncertain --> Installed: exact receipt and live binding and generation CAS
    Installed --> Installed: original receipt and unchanged installed JWT / no new generation
    Reserved --> Expired: writer clock reaches original deadline
    Uncertain --> Expired: writer clock reaches original deadline
    Installed --> [*]: retained history / successor input may reserve a new attempt
    Expired --> [*]: retained history / new Code Flow required
    note right of Reserved
        Derived timestamp facts, not a persisted status enum.
        Callback, Refresh and logout lock binding before session.
        Revoked binding, ended session or disabled principal
        prevents dispatch and installation in every state.
        Definite refusal leaves the attempt uninstalled;
        it never authorizes another rotation of that input.
    end note
